INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('DataCovey/nornweave/commit-push', 'commit-push', 'DataCovey', 'nornweave', 'community', 'commit-push DataCovey nornweave community The commit-push skill turns email providers into Inbox-as-a-Service for AI Agents, utilizing Conventional Commits for standardized commits and pushes. Commit-Push是一个开源的自托管API，能够将标准邮件提供商转为Inbox-as-a-Service，支持AI Agents的集成 Commit-Pushは、標準メールプロバイダーをInbox-as-a-Serviceに変換するオープンソースのセルフホストAPIです。AIエージェントの統合をサポートします Commit-Push는 표준 이메일 제공업체를 Inbox-as-a-Service로 변환하는 오픈소스의 자체 호스팅 API로서 AI 에이전트의 통합을 지원 Commit-push es una API de código abierto que convierte proveedores de correo electrónico estándar en un servicio de bandeja de entrada para Agentes de IA Commit-push est une API open-source qui transforme les fournisseurs de messagerie électronique standard en un service de boîte de réception pour les Agents IA Commit-push ist eine Open-Source-API, die Standard-E-Mail-Anbieter in einen Posteingangsdienst für KI-Agents umwandelt O commit-push é uma API de código aberto que transforma provedores de e-mail padrão em ''Inbox-as-a-Service'' para ferramentas de IA. Commit-push - это открытая API, которая превращает стандартных провайдеров электронной почты в ''Inbox-as-a-Service'' для ИИ Агентов. commit-push هو واجهة برمجة تطبيقات مفتوحة المصدر تحول مزودي البريد الإلكتروني المعيار إلى ''Inbox-as-a-Service'' لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي. how to use commit-push commit-push setup guide commit-push alternative what is commit-push commit-push vs Mailgun commit-push install for AI Agents Conventional Commits tutorial Inbox-as-a-Service for AI Agents Commit-Push Inbox-as-a-Service AI Agents Mailgun SES SendGrid Conventional Commits 开源API 自托管API Utilizes Conventional Commits for standardized commit messages Supports Mailgun, SES, and SendGrid email providers Automates commits and pushes to the current branch Follows best practices for commit and push operations Enables AI Agents to use Inbox-as-a-Service functionality commit-push is an open-source API that enables AI Agents to leverage standard email providers as Inbox-as-a-Service.');
