L format and checks ontology consistency, ensuring data integrity and accuracy.","zh":"rdf-ttl-pipeline是一种工具，用于关系型数据和本体论的一致性维护","ja":"rdf-ttl-pipelineは、関係型データとオントロジーの一貫性を維持するためのツールです","ko":"rdf-ttl-pipeline은 관계형 데이터와 온톨로지 간 일관성 유지에 사용되는 도구입니다","es":"rdf-ttl-pipeline es un agente de inteligencia artificial que convierte JSON a TTL y valida la coherencia de los datos","fr":"rdf-ttl-pipeline est un agent d''intelligence artificielle qui convertit JSON en TTL et valide la cohérence des données","de":"rdf-ttl-pipeline ist ein künstlicher Intelligenz-Agent, der JSON in TTL konvertiert und die Konsistenz der Daten überprüft","pt":"rdf-ttl-pipeline é uma ferramenta de processamento de dados que converte JSON para TTL e valida colunas.","ru":"rdf-ttl-pipeline - это инструмент обработки данных, который конвертирует JSON в TTL и проверяет столбцы.","ar":"rdf-ttl-pipeline هو أداة لمعالجة البيانات التي تتحول JSON إلى TTL والتحقق من العمود"},"features":{"en":["Converts JSON data to TTL format for ontology consistency","Validates column usage against a single source of truth (SSOT)","Generates TTL files and logs used columns for auditing","Performs ontology consistency checks to ensure data integrity","Loads column specifications from JSON files for configuration","Creates validation reports for data quality assurance"],"zh":["支持JSON到TTL的转换","提供使用列审计日志","支持本体论一致性验证","支持单一真实源（SSOT）","提供验证报告"],"ja":["JSONからTTLへの変換をサポート","使用列監査ログを提供","オントロジーの一貫性検証をサポート","単一真実源（SSOT）をサポート","検証レポートを提供"],"ko":["JSON → TTL 변환 지원","사용 컬럼 감사 로그 제공","온톨로지 정합성 확인 지원","단일 진실원（SSOT） 지원","검증 리포트 제공"],"es":["Conversión de JSON a TTL","Validación de la coherencia de los datos","Uso de columnas de especificación (SSOT)","Generación de registros de auditoría","Validación de la consistencia de los datos con la ontología"],"fr":["Conversion de JSON en TTL","Validation de la cohérence des données","Utilisation de colonnes de spécification (SSOT)","Génération de journaux d''audit","Validation de la consistance des données avec l''ontologie"],"de":["Konvertierung von JSON in TTL","Überprüfung der Konsistenz der Daten","Verwendung von Spalten-Spezifikationen (SSOT)","Erstellung von Prüfprotokollen","Überprüfung der Konsistenz der Daten mit der Ontologie"],"pt":["Conversão de JSON para TTL","Validação de colunas","Manutenção da consistência entre dados relacionais e ontologias","Geração de relatórios de validação","Suporte a HVDC JSON dados"],"ru":["Конвертация JSON в TTL","Проверка столбцов","Поддержание согласованности между реляционными данными и онтологиями","Генерация отчетов проверки","Поддержка HVDC JSON-данных"],"ar":["تحويل JSON إلى TTL","التحقق من العمود","الحفاظ على الاتساق بين البيانات العلائقية والمنطق","توليد تقارير التحقق","دعم HVDC JSON البيانات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use rdf-ttl-pipeline","rdf-ttl-pipeline setup guide","json to ttl conversion","ontology consistency checking","rdf-ttl-pipeline alternative","rdf-ttl-pipeline vs other conversion tools","maintaining data integrity with rdf-ttl-pipeline","installing rdf-ttl-pipeline","rdf-ttl-pipeline best practices"],"zh":["rdf-ttl-pipeline","JSON转TTL","关系型数据","本体论","一致性维护","AI工具","数据转换","数据验证"],"ja":["rdf-ttl-pipeline","JSONからTTL","関係型データ","オントロジー","一貫性維持","AIエージェント","データ変換","データ検証"],"ko":["rdf-ttl-pipeline","JSON → TTL","관계형 데이터","온톨로지","일관성 유지","AI 에이전트","데이터 변환","데이터 검증"],"es":["rdf-ttl-pipeline","integración de datos","conversión de JSON a TTL","validación de la coherencia de los datos","agente de inteligencia artificial","herramienta de integración de datos","ontología de datos","especificación de columnas","registros de auditoría"],"fr":["rdf-ttl-pipeline","intégration de données","conversion de JSON en TTL","validation de la cohérence des données","agent d''intelligence artificielle","outil d''intégration de données","ontologie de données","spécification de colonnes","journaux d''audit"],"de":["rdf-ttl-pipeline","Datenintegration","Konvertierung von JSON in TTL","Überprüfung der Konsistenz der Daten","küns