INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('CodingItWrong/riverbed-api/static-checks', 'static-checks', 'CodingItWrong', 'riverbed-api', 'community', 'static-checks CodingItWrong riverbed-api community The static-checks skill provides automated code validation for Riverbed apps, helping developers ensure code quality and functionality. 静态检查是 Riverbed CRUD 应用的重要组成部分，通过运行 rspec 测试和标准化代码格式来确保应用的稳定性和可维护性 静的チェックは Riverbed CRUD アプリの重要なコンポーネントであり、rspec テストの実行とコード形式の標準化を通じて、アプリの安定性とメンテナンス性を確保します 정적 확인은 Riverbed CRUD 애플리케이션의 중요한 구성 요소로서 rspec 테스트 실행 및 코드 형식 표준화를 통해 애플리케이션의 안정성 및 유지 보수성을 보장합니다 El skill de comprobaciones estáticas ejecuta pruebas automatizadas con rspec y standardrb para garantizar la calidad del código en Riverbed Le skill de vérifications statiques exécute des tests automatisés avec rspec et standardrb pour assurer la qualité du code dans Riverbed Das Skill für statische Prüfungen führt automatisierte Tests mit rspec und standardrb durch, um die Qualität des Codes in Riverbed zu gewährleisten Verificações estáticas para o aplicativo Riverbed, incluindo testes RSpec e formatação de código com standardrb Статические проверки для приложения Riverbed, включая тесты RSpec и форматирование кода с standardrb الفحوصات الثابتة لبرنامج ريفر بيد، بما في ذلك اختبارات RSpec وتنسيق الكود مع standardrb how to use static-checks what is static-checks static-checks alternative static-checks vs rspec static-checks install static-checks setup guide automated code validation Riverbed app development rspec testing standardrb formatting 静态检查 Riverbed CRUD rspec 测试 代码格式标准化 标准化代码 代码优化 应用性能优化 代码稳定性 代码可维护性 Runs the full rspec test suite with bin/rspec to identify code failures Fixes format issues with standardrb --fix for consistent code formatting Validates application functionality to prevent bugs and errors Enables developers to write high-quality code for Riverbed apps Supports automated testing and validation for Riverbed app development Uses standardrb to enforce coding standards and best practices static-checks is a backend API that runs automated tests and format checks for Riverbed apps, using tools like rspec and standardrb.');
