l Commits format.","zh":"Commit Changes 是一个用于分析 Common Crawl News 文件的 CLI 工具，支持 Conventional Commits 格式","ja":"Commit Changes は、Common Crawl News ファイルを分析する CLI ツールで、Conventional Commits フォーマットをサポート","ko":"Commit Changes는 Common Crawl News 파일을 분석하는 CLI 툴로 Conventional Commits 형식을 지원합니다","es":"Commit-changes es una herramienta de línea de comandos para analizar archivos de noticias de Common Crawl utilizando convenciones de commits","fr":"Commit-changes est un outil en ligne de commande pour analyser les fichiers de nouvelles de Common Crawl en utilisant des conventions de commits","de":"Commit-changes ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool für die Analyse von Common Crawl News-Dateien unter Verwendung von Commit-Konventionen","pt":"O commit-changes é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para análise de arquivos CC-NEWS","ru":"commit-changes - инструмент командной строки для анализа файлов CC-NEWS","ar":"commit-changes هو أداة سطر الأوامر لتحليل ملفات CC-NEWS"},"features":{"en":["Analyzes Common Crawl News files (CC-NEWS) for commit analysis","Creates Git commits following the Conventional Commits format","Supports commit types such as feat and fix","Ensures all validations are complete, including linting and formatting","Reviews staged diff and task context for accurate commit messages","References .cursor/skills/commits/conventional-commits.md for commit type guidance"],"zh":["支持 Conventional Commits 格式","分析 Common Crawl News 文件","CLI 工具，易于使用","自动提交更改","支持多种提交类型（feat、fix 等）"],"ja":["Conventional Commits フォーマットをサポート","Common Crawl News ファイルを分析","CLI ツール、使いやすい","自動で変更をコミット","複数のコミットタイプ（feat、fix など）をサポート"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 형식 지원","Common Crawl News 파일 분석","CLI 툴, 사용하기 쉽습니다","자동으로 변경 사항을 커밋","다양한 커밋 유형（feat, fix 등）을 지원합니다"],"es":["Análisis de archivos de noticias de Common Crawl","Seguimiento de convenciones de commits para garantizar la calidad del código","Uso de Git para crear commits","Soporte para tipos de commits como feat y fix","Validación de código mediante linting y formatting","Ejecución de tests para garantizar la calidad del código"],"fr":["Analyse de fichiers de nouvelles de Common Crawl","Suivi des conventions de commits pour assurer la qualité du code","Utilisation de Git pour créer des commits","Prise en charge de types de commits tels que feat et fix","Validation de code via linting et formatting","Exécution de tests pour assurer la qualité du code"],"de":["Analyse von Common Crawl News-Dateien","Einhaltung von Commit-Konventionen für die Code-Qualität","Verwendung von Git für die Erstellung von Commits","Unterstützung von Commit-Typen wie feat und fix","Code-Validierung durch Linting und Formatting","Ausführung von Tests für die Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Análise de arquivos CC-NEWS","Criação de commits convencionais","Uso de formato de commits Conventional Commits","Validação de linting, formatação e testes","Revisão de diff e contexto da tarefa"],"ru":["Анализ файлов CC-NEWS","Создание конвенциональных коммитов","Использование формата коммитов Conventional Commits","Валидация linting, форматирования и тестов","Проверка diff и контекста задачи"],"ar":["تحليل ملفات CC-NEWS","إنشاء تعليقات تقليدية","استخدام تنسيق التعليقات التقليدية","التحقق من تنسيق واختبار","مراجعة الاختلاف والسياق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use commit-changes","commit-changes alternative","commit-changes setup guide","conventional commits tutorial","CC-NEWS file analysis","Git commit best practices","commit-changes vs git-commit","install commit-changes","commit-changes documentation"],"zh":["Commit Changes","Conventional Commits","Common Crawl News","CLI 工具","自动提交","代码分析","AI 工具","AI 에이전트"],"ja":["Commit Changes","Conventional Commits","Common Crawl News","CLI ツール","自動コミット","コード分析","AI エージェント","開発ツール"],"ko":["Commit Changes","Conventional Commits","Common Crawl News","CLI 툴","자동 커밋","코드 분석","AI 툴","개발 도구"],"es":["commit-changes","análisis de noticias","Common Crawl","convenciones de commits","Git","linting","formatting","tests","calidad del código","herramientas de línea de comandos"],"fr":["commit-changes","analyse de nouvelles","Common Crawl","conventions de commits","Git","linting","formatting","tests","qualité du code","outils en ligne de commande"],"de":["commit-changes","Analyse von News","Common Crawl","Commit-Konventionen","Git","Linting","Formatting","Tests","Code-Qualität","Kommandozeilen-Tools"],"pt":["commit-changes","análise de arquivos CC-NEWS","ferramenta CLI","commits convencionais","Conventional Commits","validação de linting","formatação de código"],"ru":["commit-changes","анализ файлов CC-NEWS","инструмент ИИ Агентов","конвенциональные коммиты","Conventional Commits","валидация linting","форматирование кода"],"ar":["commit-changes","تحليل ملفات CC-NEWS","أداة تحليل","التعليقات التقليدية","Conventional Commits","التحقق من التنسيق","اختبار الكود"]}},"owner":"richardm","repo":"cc_news","repoPath":"richardm/cc_news","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.510Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit-changes","description":"Commit changes to the repository following Conventional Commits.","bodyPreview":"# Commit Changes\n\nCommit changes to the repository following Conventional Commits.\n\n## Creating Git commits\n\n1. Ensure all validations are complete (linting, formatting, tests pass).\n2. Review the staged diff and the context of the task (user request, GitHub Issue, etc.) to determine the appropriate commit type.\n3. Refer to `.cursor/skills/commits/conventional-commits.md` for the Conventional Commits format and available types.\n4. Use your best judgment when choosing the commit type (`feat`, `fi","body":"# Commit Changes\n\nCommit changes to the repository following Conventional Commits.\n\n## Creating Git commits\n\n1. Ensure all validations are complete (linting, formatting, tests pass).\n2. Review the staged diff and the context of the task (user request, GitHub Issue, etc.) to determine the appropriate commit type.\n3. Refer to `.cursor/skills/commits/conventional-commits.md` for the Conventional Commits format and available types.\n4. Use your best judgment when choosing the commit type (`feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`, etc.) — pick the type that most accurately describes the **intent** of the change.\n5. Write a concise subject line in imperative mood (e.g., \"add parser for WARC records\", not \"added parser\").\n6. Include a body only when the subject line alone is not sufficient to explain **why** the change was made.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:24.887Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined Git commit management with Conventional Commits support.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 Git 提交管理并支持 Conventional Commits 的开发代理。","ja":"Conventional Commits をサポートする Git コミット管理をストリームライン化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Conventional Commits를 지원하는 Git 커밋 관리를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de commits de Git optimizada con soporte para Commits Convencionales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de commits Git rationalisée avec une prise en charge des Commits Conventionnels.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine optimierte Git-Commit-Verwaltung mit Unterstützung für Conventional Commits benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de commits Git simplificado com suporte a Commits Convencionais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент коммитов Git с поддержкой Conventional Commits.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة التزامات الجيت المبسطة مع دعم Commits التقليدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create standardized Git commits following Conventional Commits format, utilizing CLI tools for efficient repository management and ensuring consistency with linting, formatting, and tests validation.","zh":"赋予代理创建标准化的 Git 提交，遵循 Conventional Commits 格式，利用 CLI 工具进行高效的仓库管理，并确保与 linting、格式化和测试验证的一致性。","ja":"エージェントが Conventional Commits 形式に従って標準化された Git コミットを作成できるようにし、CLI ツールを使用してリポジトリ管理を効率化し、linting、フォーマット、テストの検証と一貫性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 Conventional Commits 형식을 따르는 표준화된 Git 커밋을 생성할 수 있도록 해주고, CLI 도구를 사용하여 저장소 관리를 효율화하며, linting, 형식 지정 및 테스트 검증과 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear commits de Git estandarizados siguiendo el formato de Commits Convencionales, utilizando herramientas de CLI para una gestión eficiente de los repositorios y garantizando la consistencia con la verificación de linting, formato y validación de pruebas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des commits Git standardisés suivant le format des Commits Conventionnels, en utilisant des outils CLI pour une gestion efficace des référentiels et en garantissant la cohérence avec la vérification de linting, de formatage et de validation des tests.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, standardisierte Git-Commits im Conventional-Commits-Format zu erstellen, indem CLI-Tools für eine effiziente Repository-Verwaltung verwendet werden und die Konsistenz mit Linting-, Formatierungs- und Testvalidierungsprüfungen sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar commits Git padronizados seguindo o formato Conventional Commits, utilizando ferramentas CLI para gerenciamento eficiente de repositórios e garantindo consistência com linting, formatação e validação de testes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать стандартизированные коммиты Git в формате Conventional Commits, используя инструменты CLI для эффективного управления репозиториями и обеспечивая согласованность с linting, форматированием и проверкой тестов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء التزامات جيت معيارية باتباع تنسيق Commits التقليدية، واستخدام أدوات CLI لإدارة المستودعات بفعالية وضمان الاتساق مع linting والتنسيق وتحقق الاختبارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit creation for Common Crawl News files","Generating Conventional Commits for GitHub repositories","Streamlining commit validation and review processes"],"zh":["自动创建 Common Crawl News 文件的提交","为 GitHub 仓库生成 Conventional Commits","简化提交验证和审查过程"],"ja":["Common Crawl News ファイルのコミットの自動作成","GitHub リポジトリの Conventional Commits の生成","コミットの検証とレビューのプロセスの合理化"],"ko":["Common Crawl News 파일의 커밋 자동 생성","GitHub 저장소의 Conventional Commits 생성","커밋 검증 및 리뷰 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de commits para archivos de noticias de Common Crawl","Generación de Commits Convencionales para repositorios de GitHub","Optimización de los procesos de validación y revisión de commits"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de commits pour les fichiers de nouvelles de Common Crawl","Génération de Commits Conventionnels pour les référentiels GitHub","Optimisation des processus de validation et de révision de commits"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Commits für Common-Crawl-News-Dateien","Erzeugung von Conventional Commits für GitHub-Repositorys","Optimierung der Überprüfungs- und Überprüfungsprozesse für Commits"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de commits para arquivos de notícias do Common Crawl","Gerar Commits Convencionais para repositórios do GitHub","Simplificar os processos de validação e revisão de commits"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание коммитов для файлов новостей Common Crawl","Генерировать коммиты Conventional Commits для репозиториев GitHub","Упростить процессы проверки и рассмотрения коммитов"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إنشاء التزامات للملفات الإخبارية من Common Crawl","توليد Commits التقليدية لمستودعات GitHub","تبسيط عمليات التحقق والمراجعة للتزامات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Limited to Conventional Commits format","Needs CLI tool integration"],"zh":["需要 Git 仓库访问权限","仅限 Conventional Commits 格式","需要 CLI 工具集成"],"ja":["Git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","Conventional Commits 形式のみ","CLI ツールの統合が必要"],"ko":["Git 저장소 액세스 권한이 필요","Conventional Commits 형식만 해당","CLI 도구 통합이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Git","Limitado al formato de Commits Convencionales","Necesita integración de herramientas de CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Limité au format des Commits Conventionnels","Nécessite une intégration d''outils CLI"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Begrenzt auf das Conventional-Commits-Format","Benötigt Integration von CLI-Tools"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório Git","Limitado ao formato Conventional Commits","Necessita de integração com ferramentas CLI"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к репозиторию Git","Ограничен форматом Conventional Commits","Требуется интеграция с инструментами CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع الجيت","محدود بتنسيق Commits التقليدية","يحتاج إلى دمج أدوات CLI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e6abb98acf67695e82802edb5a9281d2a19fe9763f842a1cd6f7b7f58d826781","qualityScore":20}');
