INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('richardm/cc_news/commit-changes', 'commit-changes', 'richardm', 'cc_news', 'community', 'commit-changes richardm cc_news community The commit-changes skill is a CLI tool for analyzing Common Crawl News files and creating Git commits following Conventional Commits. It benefits developers and AI agents by streamlining the commit process. Commit Changes 是一个 CLI 工具，用于分析 Common Crawl News 文件，并按照 Conventional Commits 格式提交更改 Commit Changes は、Common Crawl News ファイルを分析し、Conventional Commits フォーマットに従って変更をコミットする CLI ツールです Commit Changes는 Common Crawl News 파일을 분석하고 Conventional Commits 형식에 따라 변경 사항을 커밋하는 CLI 툴입니다 Commit-changes es una herramienta de línea de comandos para analizar archivos de noticias de Common Crawl. Sigue las convenciones de commits para garantizar la calidad del código. Commit-changes est un outil en ligne de commande pour analyser les fichiers de nouvelles de Common Crawl. Il suit les conventions de commits pour assurer la qualité du code. Commit-changes ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool für die Analyse von Common Crawl News-Dateien. Es folgt den Commit-Konventionen, um die Code-Qualität zu gewährleisten. O commit-changes é uma ferramenta CLI para análise de arquivos CC-NEWS, que ajuda a criar commits convencionais e melhorar a produtividade commit-changes - инструмент ИИ Агентов для анализа файлов CC-NEWS, giúp создавать конвенциональные коммиты и улучшать производительность commit-changes هو أداة تحليل ملفات CC-NEWS، تساعد على création التعليقات التقليدية وتحسين الإنتاجية how to use commit-changes commit-changes alternative commit-changes setup guide conventional commits tutorial CC-NEWS file analysis Git commit best practices commit-changes vs git-commit install commit-changes commit-changes documentation Commit Changes Conventional Commits Common Crawl News CLI 工具 自动提交 代码分析 AI 工具 AI 에이전트 Analyzes Common Crawl News files (CC-NEWS) for commit analysis Creates Git commits following the Conventional Commits format Supports commit types such as feat and fix Ensures all validations are complete, including linting and formatting Reviews staged diff and task context for accurate commit messages References .cursor/skills/commits/conventional-commits.md for commit type guidance commit-changes is a CLI tool for analyzing CC-NEWS files and creating standardized Git commits using the Conventional Commits format.');
