INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('MakiOmar/DoctorAppointmenets/multilingial', 'multilingial', 'MakiOmar', 'DoctorAppointmenets', 'community', 'multilingial MakiOmar DoctorAppointmenets community The multilingial skill considers Arabic and RTL formats, maintaining existing multilingual content. It benefits developers working with AI agents and multilingual support. multilingial功能允许维持已有多语言内容，并考虑rtl的支持 multilingial機能は既存のマルチリンガルコンテンツを維持し、rtlをサポートします multilingial 기능은 기존 멀티링구얼 콘텐츠를 유지하고 rtl을 지원합니다 El skill multilingüe permite la configuración de Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial para contenido en varios idiomas, incluyendo árabe y rtl. Le skill multilingue permet la configuration d''outils d''IA pour du contenu dans plusieurs langues, y compris l''arabe et rtl. Das multilingue Skill ermöglicht die Konfiguration von KI-Tools für Inhalt in mehreren Sprachen, einschließlich Arabisch und rtl. Desenvolva aplicativos com suporte à linguagem árabe e RTL ИИ Агенты с поддержкой языка العربية и RTL دعم اللغة العربية وتصميم الواجهات المتوافقة مع اللغة how to use multilingial what is multilingial multilingial alternative multilingial vs language skills multilingial install multilingial setup guide multilingial RTL support 多语言支持 rtl支持 AI工具 多语言设置 multilingial功能 语言检测 Considers Arabic and RTL formats for AI agents Maintains existing multilingual content Supports cancellation of multilingual content Retains existing multilingual setup for AI agents multilingial is a skill that supports right-to-left languages like Arabic, maintaining existing multilingual content for AI agents.');
