DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'MarjanDB/brrr-generator/infoproviders-lookup-data';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('MarjanDB/brrr-generator/infoproviders-lookup-data', 'infoproviders-lookup-data', 'MarjanDB', 'brrr-generator', 'community', 'infoproviders-lookup-data MarjanDB brrr-generator community The infoproviders-lookup-data skill generates tax reports for brokerage accounts, utilizing lookup data for company and country information. It benefits developers and users who need to comply with tax authority regulations. infoproviders-lookup-data是一个用于生成税务报告的AI工具，支持CompanyLookupProvider和CountryLookupProvider infoproviders-lookup-dataは、税務報告を生成するためのAIエージェントです。CompanyLookupProviderとCountryLookupProviderを使用します infoproviders-lookup-data는 税務報告를 생성하는 AI 도구입니다. CompanyLookupProvider와 CountryLookupProvider를 지원합니다 infoproviders-lookup-data es una habilidad de AI Agent que permite generar informes de impuestos para la autoridad fiscal de tu país. Utiliza proveedores de búsqueda de empresas y países para resolver ISIN y códigos de país. infoproviders-lookup-data est une compétence d''AI Agent qui permet de générer des rapports de taxes pour l''autorité fiscale de votre pays. Elle utilise des fournisseurs de recherche d''entreprises et de pays pour résoudre les ISIN et les codes de pays. infoproviders-lookup-data ist eine Fähigkeit von Ii Agenten, die die Erstellung von Steuererklärungen für die Finanzbehörde Ihres Landes ermöglicht. Sie verwendet Anbieter von Unternehmens- und Ländersuche, um ISIN und Ländercodes aufzulösen. O InfoProviders e lookup de dados permite gerar relatórios de impostos de corretagem para a autoridade fiscal do seu país, utilizando tecnologias como CompanyLookupProvider e CountryLookupProvider. Используя InfoProviders и lookup данных, вы можете сгенерировать налоговые отчеты брокерского счета для налогового органа вашей страны, используя технологии như CompanyLookupProvider и CountryLookupProvider. باستخدام InfoProviders وبيانات البحث، يمكنك إنشاء تقارير ضريبية لحساب الوساطة لسلطة الضرائب في بلدك، باستخدام تقنيات مثل CompanyLookupProvider وCountryLookupProvider. how to use infoproviders-lookup-data infoproviders-lookup-data setup guide infoproviders-lookup-data alternative infoproviders-lookup-data vs tax reporting software what is infoproviders-lookup-data infoproviders-lookup-data install generating tax reports with infoproviders-lookup-data company lookup provider country lookup provider json lookup files for tax reporting infoproviders-lookup-data AIエージェント 税務报告 CompanyLookupProvider CountryLookupProvider 数据查找 税务条约 Utilizes CompanyLookupProvider to resolve ISIN to company info Employs CountryLookupProvider to resolve country name to 2-letter code and treaty info Falls back to missingCompaniesLookup.json and missingISINLookup.json for missing data Supports online lookup for company and country information Uses JSON lookup files for data storage and retrieval Resolves country-specific treaty formats for tax reporting infoproviders-lookup-data is a skill that provides lookup data for generating tax reports, using JSON files and online lookups to resolve company and country information.');
