 Node.js"],"pt":["Utiliza bancos de dados gráficos para negociar","Permite a criação de aplicações de trading avançadas","É projetado para desenvolvedores","Suporta XBRL, News e Reports","Oferece uma solução de trading personalizável"],"ru":["Использует графические базы данных для торговли","Позволяет создавать продвинутые торговые приложения","Предназначен для разработчиков","Поддерживает XBRL, News и Reports","Предлагает настраиваемое торговое решение"],"ar":["يستخدم قواعد البيانات الرسومية للتداول","يسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات تداول متقدمة","تم تصميمه للمطورين","يدعم XBRL و News و Reports","يقدم حل تداول قابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mock Orchestrator 使用教程","AI代理交易工具","图数据库金融分析","XBRL数据处理","Python交易策略","Node.js金融市场模拟","mock-orchestrator 安装指南","智能交易代理 alternative","如何设置mock-orchestrator","金融AI工具比较"],"ja":["Mock Orchestrator 使い方","AIエージェント取引ツール","グラフDB金融分析","XBRLデータ処理","Python取引戦略","Node.js金融市場シミュレーション","mock-orchestrator インストール","智能取引エージェント alternative","mock-orchestrator 設定方法","金融AIツール比較"],"ko":["Mock Orchestrator 사용법","AI 에이전트 트레이딩 도구","그래프 DB 금융 분석","XBRL 데이터 처리","Python 트레이딩 전략","Node.js 금융 시장 시뮬레이션","mock-orchestrator 설치 가이드","지능형 트레이딩 에이전트 alternative","mock-orchestrator 설정 방법","금융 AI 도구 비교"],"es":["mock orchestrator install","agentes IA trading financiero","base de datos grafos XBRL","how to use mock orchestrator","mock orchestrator vs backtrader","automatizar trading con Python","simulador estrategias trading","mock orchestrator setup guide","agentes inteligentes mercados financieros"],"fr":["mock orchestrator install","agents IA trading financier","base de données graphe XBRL","how to use mock orchestrator","mock orchestrator vs backtrader","automatiser trading avec Python","simulateur stratégies trading","mock orchestrator setup guide","agents intelligents marchés financiers"],"de":["mock orchestrator install","KI-Agenten Finanzhandel","Graph-Datenbank XBRL","how to use mock orchestrator","mock orchestrator vs backtrader","automatisieren trading mit Python","simulator handelsstrategien","mock orchestrator setup guide","intelligente agenten finanzmärkte"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","mock-orchestrator","bancos de dados gráficos para trading","aplicações de trading avançadas"," XBRL para trading","Guia de instalação do mock-orchestrator","Como usar o mock-orchestrator","Alternativas ao mock-orchestrator"],"ru":["ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","mock-orchestrator","Графические базы данных для торговли","Продвинутые торговые приложения","XBRL для торговли","Руководство по установке mock-orchestrator","Как использовать mock-orchestrator","Альтернативы mock-orchestrator"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","mock-orchestrator","قواعد البيانات الرسومية للتداول","تطبيقات تداول متقدمة","XBRL للتداول","دليل تثبيت mock-orchestrator","كيفية استخدام mock-orchestrator","بديلات mock-orchestrator"]}},"owner":"faisalanjum","repo":"EventTrader","repoPath":"faisalanjum/EventTrader","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T13:05:37.068Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mock-orchestrator","description":"Mock orchestrator for 4-layer thinking test. Calls prediction and attribution skills.","bodyPreview":"# Mock Orchestrator (Layer 1)\n\n**Goal**: Test thinking token capture across 4 layers: Main → Orchestrator → Prediction/Attribution → Task Subagents\n\n**Thinking**: Use `ultrathink` for this analysis.\n\n## Task\n\n1. Think about the 4-layer architecture we''re testing\n2. Write your reasoning to: `earnings-analysis/test-outputs/mock-orchestrator-reasoning.txt`\n3. Call `/mock-prediction` skill (Layer 2 → Layer 3)\n4. Call `/mock-attribution` skill (Layer 2 → Layer 3)\n5. After both complete, write final s","body":"# Mock Orchestrator (Layer 1)\n\n**Goal**: Test thinking token capture across 4 layers: Main → Orchestrator → Prediction/Attribution → Task Subagents\n\n**Thinking**: Use `ultrathink` for this analysis.\n\n## Task\n\n1. Think about the 4-layer architecture we''re testing\n2. Write your reasoning to: `earnings-analysis/test-outputs/mock-orchestrator-reasoning.txt`\n3. Call `/mock-prediction` skill (Layer 2 → Layer 3)\n4. Call `/mock-attribution` skill (Layer 2 → Layer 3)\n5. After both complete, write final summary to: `earnings-analysis/test-outputs/mock-orchestrator-final.txt`\n\nInclude in your files:\n- Note that this is \"mock-orchestrator (Layer 1)\"\n- Summary of what each child skill returned\n- The complete layer structure being tested\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T14:19:33.049Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing layered architecture testing and token capture analysis across multiple layers","zh":"适合需要分层架构测试和token捕获分析的高级AI代理","ja":"レイヤードアーキテクチャのテストとトークンキャプチャ分析が必要な高度なAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"레이어드 아키텍처 테스트 및 토큰 캡처 분석이 필요한 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Avanzados que necesitan pruebas de arquitectura en capas y análisis de captura de tokens en varias capas","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de IA Avancés nécessitant des tests d''architecture en couches et d''analyse de capture de jetons sur plusieurs couches","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die eine schichtübergreifende Architekturtests und Token-Erfassungsanalyse benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de teste de arquitetura em camadas e análise de captura de token em várias camadas","ru":"Идеально подходит для передовых агентов ИИ, которым требуется тестирование многослойной архитектуры и анализ захвата токенов на нескольких слоях","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبار هندسة طبقات متعددة وتحليل захف_token عبر عدة طبقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to test thinking token capture using ultrathink analysis, facilitating calls to /mock-prediction and /mock-attribution skills, and leveraging graph databases like XBRL for comprehensive content analysis","zh":"赋予代理使用超级思考分析测试思维token捕获的能力，实现调用/mock-prediction和/mock-attribution技能，并利用XBRL等图数据库进行全面内容分析","ja":"エージェントに、超思考分析を使用して思考トークンキャプチャをテストする能力を与え、/mock-predictionと/mock-attributionスキルへの呼び出しを容易にし、XBRLなどのグラフデータベースを使用した包括的なコンテンツ分析を可能にします","ko":"에이전트에게 초고급思考 분석을 사용하여 사고 토큰 캡처를 테스트할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, /mock-prediction 및 /mock-attribution 스킬 호출을 쉽게 하며, XBRL과 같은 그래프 데이터베이스를 사용한 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a probar la captura de tokens de pensamiento utilizando el análisis de ultrapensamiento, facilitando llamadas a /mock-prediction y /mock-attribution skills, y aprovechando bases de datos de grafo como XBRL para un análisis de contenido integral","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester la capture de jetons de réflexion en utilisant l''analyse d''ultrapensée, facilitant les appels aux compétences /mock-prediction et /mock-attribution, et exploitant les bases de données de graphes comme XBRL pour une analyse de contenu complète","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, das Erfassen von Denktoken mithilfe der Ultradenkanalyse zu testen, indem es Aufrufe an /mock-prediction und /mock-attribution-Fähigkeiten ermöglicht und Graphendatenbanken wie XBRL für eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar a captura de token de pensamento usando análise ultrathink, facilitando chamadas para as habilidades /mock-prediction e /mock-attribution, e aproveitando bases de dados gráficas como XBRL para análise de conteúdo abrangente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тестировать захват токенов мышления с помощью анализа ultrathink, облегчая вызовы навыков /mock-prediction и /mock-attribution, и использует графические базы данных, такие как XBRL, для всестороннего анализа контента","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على اختبار захف_token الفكر باستخدام تحليل ultrathink، و تسهيل الاتصالات بخدمات /mock-prediction و /mock-attribution، وتسخير قواعد البيانات الرسومية مثل XBRL لتحليل المحتوى الشامل"},"useCases":{"en":["Testing 4-layer architecture integrations","Analyzing token capture across multiple layers","Integrating with graph databases for advanced content analysis"],"zh":["测试4层架构集成","分析跨多个层的token捕获","与图数据库集成进行高级内容分析"],"ja":["4層アーキテクチャの統合をテストする","複数の層を跨ぐトークンキャプチャを分析する","グラフデータベースと統合して高度なコンテンツ分析を行う"],"ko":["4계층 아키텍처 통합 테스트","여러 계층을跨는 토큰 캡처 분석","그래프 데이터베이스와의 통합을 통한 고급 콘텐츠 분석"],"es":["Pruebas de integración de arquitectura de 4 capas","Análisis de captura de tokens en varias capas","Integración con bases de datos de grafo para un análisis de contenido avanzado"],"fr":["Tests d''intégration d''architecture 4 couches","Analyse de capture de jetons sur plusieurs couches","Intégration avec des bases de données de graphes pour une analyse de contenu avancée"],"de":["Tests von 4-Schichten-Architektur-Integrationen","Analyse des Token-Erfassens über mehrere Schichten","Integration mit Graphendatenbanken für eine erweiterte Inhaltsanalyse"],"pt":["Testar integrações de arquitetura de 4 camadas","Analizar captura de token em várias camadas","Integrar com bases de dados gráficas para análise de conteúdo avançada"],"ru":["Тестировать интеграции архитектуры 4-го уровня","Анализировать захват токенов на нескольких слоях","Интегрироваться с графическими базами данных для расширенного анализа контента"],"ar":["اختبار التكاملات هندسية 4 طبقات","تحليل захف_token عبر عدة طبقات","التكامل مع قواعد البيانات الرسومية لتحليل المحتوى المتقدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ultrathink analysis capability","Limited to testing mock orchestrator layer","Dependent on /mock-prediction and /mock-attribution skills"],"zh":["需要超级思考分析功能","仅限于测试模拟编排器层","依赖/mock-prediction和/mock-attribution技能"],"ja":["超思考分析機能が必要","モックオーケストレータ層のテストに限定される","/mock-predictionと/mock-attributionスキルに依存する"],"ko":["초고급思考 분석 기능이 필요","모의 오케스트레이터 계층 테스트에만 제한","/mock-prediction 및 /mock-attribution 스킬에 의존"],"es":["Requiere capacidad de análisis de ultrapensamiento","Limitado a la prueba de la capa de orquestador mock","Dependiente de /mock-prediction y /mock-attribution skills"],"fr":["Nécessite une capacité d''analyse d''ultrapensée","Limité au test de la couche d''orchestrateur mock","Dépendant des compétences /mock-prediction et /mock-attribution"],"de":["Benötigt Ultradenkanalyse-Fähigkeit","Begrenzt auf das Testen der Mock-Orchestrierungsschicht","Abhängig von /mock-prediction und /mock-attribution-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige capacidade de análise ultrathink","Limitado ao teste da camada do orquestrador mock","Dependente das habilidades /mock-prediction e /mock-attribution"],"ru":["Требует возможности анализа ultrathink","Ограничен тестированием слоя mock-оркестратора","Зависит от навыков /mock-prediction и /mock-attribution"],"ar":["يتطلب القدرة على تحليل ultrathink","محدود باختبار طبقة الاوركسترا mock","يعتمد على خدمات /mock-prediction و /mock-attribution"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a69c532a0245c71c8b958640909a5a62a691d391681bf680fb86dd7fc491a928","qualityScore":18}');
